  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECTION OF PRIORITY STOPOVERS IN THE COASTAL FOREST OF VERACRUZ</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pronatura Veracruz and partners will increase the amount of stopover habitat protected by adding 5,000 ha (12,355 acres) and will continue generating information about migratory populations contributing data to help to determine population trends at a Continental Level. Partners will use their technical skills to improve training programs, offer formal training to local biologists, and will expand their environmental education program to other schools and communities in the region. Partners will strengthen the capabilities of local students and teachers of elementary schools, increasing the number of schools and communities reached by the program.</narrative>
  </description>
